// g7250_main_spi6_ch394.repl — CH394 Ethernet controller on SPI6
// (models/csharp/G7250Ch394.cs, docs/CH394-model.md; pins from his/40):
// CS# PG15 (input 0, frames the W5500-style SPI transfers), RST# PB5 (input 1,
// low resets the chip), INT# PC13 (output, active low). No network link here
// (bridgePort 0); product runs load the chip with the runner's bridge port.
// Load after g7250_main.repl and `i @models/csharp/G7250Ch394.cs`.
ch394: Antmicro.Renode.Peripherals.SPI.G7250Ch394 @ spi6
    IRQ -> gpioPortC@13

gpioPortG:
    15 -> ch394@0

gpioPortB:
    5 -> ch394@1
